{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Svqyn9X35nL7JdCXjT9jz3","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Agent Progress Probe - Memory\\\\n\\\\n## F1_stag Per-Class Breakdown 分析 (2026-05-14)\\\\n\\\\n### 基本信息\\\\n- 模型: probe_001 (checkpoints_full/best_model.pt)\\\\n- 测试集: 8101 windows (full split), 2206 with conf≥2\\\\n- 整体 (conf≥2): f1_stag=0.8522, macro_f1=0.8946, precision_stag=0.9509, recall_stag=0.772\\\\n\\\\n### Dim1: 按 Confidence 分层\\\\n| Conf | N | n_stag | f1_stag | prec_stag | rec_stag | f1_prog |\\\\n|------|---|--------|---------|-----------|----------|---------|\\\\n| 1 | 5895 | 1502 | 0.7452 | 0.7235 | 0.7683 | 0.9092 |\\\\n| 2 | 2149 | 711 | 0.8498 | 0.9512 | 0.7679 | 0.9359 |\\\\n| 3 | 57 | 17 | 0.9412 | 0.9412 | 0.9412 | 0.975 |\\\\n\\\\n**发现**: f1_stag 随 confidence 单调递增 (0.74→0.85→0.94)。conf=2 的瓶颈是 recall_stag=0.77 (precision 很高 0.95)。\\\\n\\\\n### Dim2: 按 Trajectory 长度分层\\\\n| 长度 | N | n_stag | f1_stag | prec_stag | rec_stag |\\\\n|------|---|--------|---------|-----------|----------|\\\\n| short (<10) | 17 | 2 | 0.0 | 0.0 | 0.0 |\\\\n| medium (10-30) | 1018 | 123 | 0.6637 | 0.74 | 0.6016 |\\\\n| long (>30) | 7066 | 2105 | 0.7836 | 0.7872 | 0.78 |\\\\n\\\\n**发现**: 中等长度 trajectory 的 f1_stag 最低 (0.66)，recall_stag 仅 0.60。长 trajectory (>30 步) 表现最好。conf≥2 下长 trajectory f1_stag=0.86。\\\\n\\\\n### Dim3: 按 LF 一致性分层\\\\n| Pattern | N | n_stag | f1_stag | f1_prog |\\\\n|---------|---|--------|---------|---------|\\\\n| 2lf_agree | 1535 | 316 | **0.9462** | 0.9861 |\\\\n| 3lf_unanimous | 57 | 17 | **0.9412** | 0.975 |\\\\n| 2lf_disagree | 1714 | 427 | 0.7829 | 0.9071 |\\\\n| 3lf_2v1_split | 614 | 395 | 0.7565 | 0.7235 |\\\\n| 1lf_only | 4181 | 1075 | 0.7266 | 0.91 |\\\\n\\\\n**发现**: LF 一致性是 f1_stag 的关键预测因子。2-LF 一致或 3-LF 全票一致时 f1_stag > 0.94；3-LF 2v1 分裂时降至 0.76，且 f1_prog 也大跌 (0.72)。\\\\n\\\\n### Dim4: 按 Outcome 分层\\\\n| Outcome | N (全) | f1_stag (全) | N (conf≥2) | f1_stag (conf≥2) |\\\\n|---------|--------|------------|------------|-------------------|\\\\n| resolved | 739 | 0.8116 | 303 | **0.3333** |\\\\n| unresolved | 7362 | 0.7755 | 1903 | 0.8545 |\\\\n\\\\n**发现**: conf≥2 下 resolved 的 f1_stag 骤降至 0.33，因为 resolved trajectory 中 conf≥2 的 stag 样本极少。全测试集上 resolved 的 f1_stag (0.81) 反而略高于 unresolved (0.78)。\\\\n\\\\n### Dim5: 错误子类型分析 (conf≥2)\\\\n**Missed Stagnation (FP in standard CM, N=166)**:\\\\n- **100% 来自 unresolved** trajectory\\\\n- 89% 是 3lf_2v1_split pattern (OB 投 progress 但整体标为 stag)\\\\n- 99% 的 OB vote = 0 (progress)\\\\n- 位置分布: last_third 58%, mid_third 31%, first_third 11%\\\\n- 平均 prob=0.776 (高置信度错误)，45% prob>0.8\\\\n\\\\n**False Stag Alarm (FN in standard CM, N=29)**:\\\\n- 86% unresolved，14% resolved\\\\n- 59% 是 2lf_agree pattern\\\\n- 平均 prob=0.215 (低置信度)\\\\n- 100% prob<0.6\\\\n\\\\n### 核心结论\\\\n1. **f1_stag 瓶颈 = recall_stag**：precision 很高 (0.95) 但 recall 偏低 (0.77)\\\\n2. **主要错误模式**: OB-与其他 LF 分歧时 (3lf_2v1_split)，probe 跟随 OB 的 progress 判断，漏掉了真实的 stagnation → 166/195 (85%) 的错误是这类\\\\n3. **高置信度盲点**: 这些 missed stagnation 的平均 sigmoid prob=0.78，probe 很\\\\\\\"确信\\\\\\\"地犯错\\\\n4. **trajectory 尾部最难**: 58% 的 missed stagnation 在 trajectory 最后 1/3\\\\n5. **LF 一致性是质量信号**: 一致时 f1_stag > 0.94，分裂时降至 0.76\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2796, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01YCtSqhgHHVtRnbSQqtrnQK","session_id":"0b19c43c-1b27-4951-bda8-40543516a891","uuid":"4d2a67fb-5bcc-4031-ad88-e223bd19c593","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:26:23.025Z"}
