cription: \"Probe on BGE-m3 embeddings\"\n60\t    priority: P1\n61\t    registry_id: encoder-ablation-probe-bgem3\n62\t\n63\t  - id: window-size\n64\t    claim: \"C1-structural\"\n65\t    description: \"Window size ablation k=5 optimal (0.9309)\"\n66\t    priority: P1\n67\t    registry_id: ablation-window-size\n68\t\n69\t  - id: data-scaling\n70\t    claim: \"C1-structural\"\n71\t    description: \"10-25-50-100% scaling curve\"\n72\t    priority: P1\n73\t    registry_id: data-scaling-v2\n74\t\n75\t  - id: arch-ablation\n76\t    claim: \"C1-structural\"\n77\t    description: \"GRU vs Transformer vs LSTM\"\n78\t    priority: P2\n79\t    registry_id: ablation-architecture\n80\t\n81\t  - id: supcon-ablation\n82\t    claim: \"C1-structural\"\n83\t    description: \"Supervised contrastive loss ablation\"\n84\t    priority: P2\n85\t    registry_id: ablation-supcon\n86\t\n87\t  - id: meanpool-lr\n88\t    claim: \"C1-structural\"\n89\t    description: \"MeanPool+LR baseline (0.8435)\"\n90\t    priority: P1\n91\t    registry_id: baseline-meanpool-lr\n92\t\n93\t  - id: lf-oracle\n94\t    claim: \"C1-structural\"\n95\t    description: \"All-Agreement oracle (0.854)\"\n96\t    priority: P1\n97\t    registry_id: baseline-lf-oracle\n98\t\n99\t  - id: error-analysis\n100\t    claim: \"C1-structural\"\n101\t    description: \"FP/FN pattern analysis\"\n102\t    priority: P1\n103\t    registry_id: error-analysis\n104\t\n105\t  # ===== Claim 2: LF Temporal Dynamics =====\n106\t\n107\t  - id: lf-temporal\n108\t    claim: \"C2-temporal\"\n109\t    description: \"SWE-Agent LF temporal roles quantification\"\n110\t    priority: P0\n111\t    registry_id: lf-temporal-dynamics\n112\t\n113\t  - id: oh-cmdrep-ablation\n114\t    claim: \"C2-temporal\"\n115\t    description: \"OH cmd_rep role reversal: removal +21.6pp\"\n116\t    priority: P0\n117\t    registry_id: oh-cmdrep-ablation\n118\t\n119\t  - id: oh-full-finetune\n120\t    claim: \"C2-temporal\"\n121\t    description: \"OH all features baseline (0.7512)\"\n122\t    priority: P0\n123\t    registry_id: oh-full-finetune\n124\t\n125\t  - id: ob-3seed\n126\t    claim: \"C2-temporal\"\n127\t    description: \"OB removal: F1_stag -22pp\"\n128\t    priority: P0\n129\t    registry_id: outcome-bp-3seed\n130\t\n131\t  - id: train-without-ob\n132\t    claim: \"C2-temporal\"\n133\t    description: \"OB holdout cross-eval\"\n134\t    priority: P0\n135\t    registry_id: train-without-ob\n136\t\n137\t  - id: data-volume-ctrl\n138\t    claim: \"C2-temporal\"\n139\t    description: \"OB signal 7.1pp vs volume 0.6pp\"\n140\t    priority: P1\n141\t    registry_id: data-volume-control\n142\t\n143\t  - id: conf-gradient\n144\t    claim: \"C2-temporal\"\n145\t    description: \"Confidence-stratified performance\"\n146\t    priority: P1\n147\t    registry_id: confidence-gradient\n148\t\n149\t  - id: lf-holdout\n150\t    claim: \"C2-temporal\"\n151\t    description: \"Per-LF coverage and cross-set generalization\"\n152\t    priority: P1\n153\t    registry_id: ablation-lf-holdout-v2\n154\t\n155\t  # ===== Claim 3: TLM Negative Finding =====\n156\t\n157\t  - id: tlm-core\n158\t    claim: \"C3-tlm-negative\"\n159\t    description: \"HMM + lag-aware HMM fail to beat MV\"\n160\t    priority: P0\n161\t    registry_id: temporal-label-model\n162\t\n163\t  - id: twv-ablation\n164\t    claim: \"C3-tlm-negative\"\n165\t    description: \"TWV sigma sweep: harmful most settings\"\n166\t    priority: P0\n167\t    registry_id: twv-ablation\n168\t\n169\t  - id: tlm-probe\n170\t    claim: \"C3-tlm-negative\"\n171\t    description: \"TWV labels degrade downstream -4.9 to -21.7pp\"\n172\t    priority: P0\n173\t    registry_id: tlm-probe-comparison\n174\t\n175\t  - id: flyingsquid\n176\t    claim: \"C3-tlm-negative\"\n177\t    description: \"FlyingSquid label model (negative)\"\n178\t    priority: P1\n179\t    registry_id: baseline_flyingsquid\n180\t\n181\t  # ===== Cross-agent =====\n182\t\n183\t  - id: cross-agent-probe\n184\t    claim: \"cross-agent\"\n185\t    description: \"Probe zero-shot transfer (negative)\"\n186\t    priority: P1\n187\t    registry_id: cross-agent-eval\n188\t\n189\t  - id: oh-fewshot\n190\t    claim: \"cross-agent\"\n191\t    description: \"Few-shot adaptation for OH\"\n192\t    priority: P1\n193\t    registry_id: openhands-fewshot-probe\n194\t\n195\t  # ===== Planned =====\n196\t\n197\t  - id: gold-set\n198\t    claim: \"all-claims\"\n199\t    description: \"Human-annotated 650 windows — GO/NO-GO gate\"\n200\t    priority: P0\n201\t    depends_on: [human_annotation]\n202\t\n203\t  - id: f1-stag-analysis\n204\t    claim: \"C2-temporal\"\n205\t    description: \"F1_stag per-class breakdown\"\n206\t    priority: P1\n207\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01YCtSqhgHHVtRnbSQqtrnQK","session_id":"0b19c43c-1b27-4951-bda8-40543516a891","uuid":"8ac1f89d-ddd7-4277-a77a-89e19e1ebc1a","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:26:42.800Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QNjdxMUBTtSW3UTvUxPhbC","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/paper_framing.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Paper Framing — agent_progress_probe\\\\n\\\\n## Target Venue\\\\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 ARR (submission deadline: May 25, 2026; commitment: August 2, 2026)\\\\n- Format: Long paper (8 pages + appendix)\\\\n- Track: LLM Agents\\\\n- Paper type: **Empirical analysis paper**（D039 pivot: 从 method paper 转 empirical study）\\\\n- Fallback: ACL 2026 ARR August cycle (~August 15 deadline)\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (3 条) — D039 Pivot\\\\n\\\\n1. **Stagnation Signals Are Structural, Not Semantic (primary contribution)**: 系统性对比发现 agent stagnation 信号本质是结构性的——30 个结构特征（命令重复率、唯一命令比、文件 diff 频率等）在 in-domain (RF 0.9951) 和 cross-agent (GB 0.967) 都近完美预测停滞，全面优于 NL embedding probe (in-domain 0.906, cross-domain 0.751) 和 LLM-as-judge (+24.3pp)。Encoder-agnostic（3 个 encoder 均 >0.90）；最优窗口 k=5 (0.9309)；data scaling 10%→100% 单调递增。这揭示：(a) stagnation detection 不需要语义理解——简单结构特征已足够；(b) 结构特征天然跨 agent 迁移（不依赖 embedding domain adaptation）；(c) NL embedding 对 stagnation detection 无增量价值。**改变社区对 agent monitoring 方法选型的认知：从昂贵的表示学习转向轻量结构监控。** Gold set 验证 structural features 是否检测到真实 stagnation（非仅 circular eval artifact）是论文成立的关键。\\\\n\\\\n2. **LF Temporal Dynamics Are Systematic but Agent-Specific (analytical contribution)**: LFs 在 trajectory 上展现**系统性但 agent-specific 的**时序角色。SWE-Agent 上：cmd_rep leading (-1.87步)、file_diff concurrent (-1.2步)、OB lagging (+6.7步)。**OH 上 cmd_rep 角色反转**（从 leading 变 lagging +3.32步），而 file_diff（leading, -4.9步）和 OB（lagging, +18.1步）跨域一致。**消融验证：去掉 cmd_rep 后 OH F1 从 0.7512 飙升到 0.9272（+21.6pp）**，证明 cmd_rep 在 OH 上是噪声源而非信号。根因：cmd_rep 在 OH 上 92.3% firing rate + 71% FP，失去区分性。这揭示 LF 行为与 agent 架构之间的交互效应——为 weak supervision pipeline 在 sequential agent data 上的设计提供实证指导。同时量化 circular evaluation 问题：structural features 以 0.9951 F1 逆向工程 LF 标签，证明 LF-derived labels 上的高分不等于真实检测能力。\\\\n\\\\n3. **Temporal Label Model: A Well-Motivated Negative Finding (D039 negative result)**: 标准 data programming（majority vote）在 agent trajectory 上违反 i.i.d. 假设——LFs 产生系统性时序动态，这 motivate 了 temporal label model（TLM）的开发。然而，三种 TLM 实现**均未能超越简单 MV**：(a) **TWV（时序加权投票）**：绝大多数 σ 下有害（twv-ablation）；唯一微弱正向的 σ=2 训练的下游分类器全面劣化（in-domain -4.9pp, cross-agent -21.7pp, conf≥2 -1.8pp）(structural-on-twv)；(b) **HMM-TLM**：stagnation class overpredict；(c) **Lag-aware HMM**：仅追平 MV（0.8936）。**结论**：在当前 3-LF、低冲突（conf≥2 一致率 95.1%）的 regime 下，temporal alignment 的收益被噪声引入抵消。TWV 改变的主要是低置信标签，但改变方向是错的。这是对 \\\\\\\"i.i.d. violation → temporal model must help\\\\\\\" 这一直觉的重要否定，为未来 temporal label model 研究提供了关键约束条件。\\\\n\\\\n## Story Spine\\\\n\\\\n- **Problem**: LLM agents 在长期任务中频繁\\\\\\\"语义停滞\\\\\\\"——执行看似合理但集体无效的动作序列。每个动作可能非重复、局部合理，但整个窗口缺乏 goal-directed progress。现有方法要么检测结构性循环（漏掉语义多样的停滞），要么做 step-level scoring（丢失窗口内的时序动态），要么依赖 LLM 自我评估（高开销 + 受困模型的判断力受限）。\\\\n\\\\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: (a) Cycle detectors（CDCS+CDSA, SpecRA, TrajAD）捕获重复/异常但漏掉语义多样的停滞；(b) Process Reward Models — **AgentPRM (Xi et al., ACM Web 2026, arxiv 2511.08325)** 是最直接的竞争者：用 TD/GAE 训练 step-level PRM 评估 \\\\\\\"promise and progress\\\\\\\"，但需要 outcome labels + RL pipeline，是 training signal 而非 monitoring tool。另有 PRM framework (arxiv 2502.10325)、ToolPRMBench (arxiv 2601.12294)、trajectory-level reward modeling (arxiv 2604.08178)。PRM 方向在 2025-2026 非常拥挤，我们的差异：**不需要 outcome labels**、**window-level 捕获 temporal dynamics**、**monitoring 而非 training**；(c) Self-reflection（Reflexion, LATS, Tree of Thoughts）依赖被困模型的自我评估，且是 intervention 而非 monitoring；(d) RL value functions (CodeRL) 需要 reward shaping；(e) **Agent monitoring 新方向**：\\\\\\\"Monitoring LLM Agents for Sequentially Contextual Harm\\\\\\\" (ICLR 2025 Workshop) 论证了 sequence-level monitoring 的必要性（单步分析不够）；\\\\\\\"Reliable Weak-to-Strong Monitoring\\\\\\\" (arxiv 2508.19461) 研究了弱模型监控强 agent，但关注 safety 而非 progress；(f) **Agent degradation benchmark**：SlopCodeBench (arxiv 2603.24755, 2026) 量化了 coding agent 在长期任务中的退化——verbosity 90% 轨迹上升、erosion 80%——为我们的 problem motivation 提供了最新实证。\\\\n\\\\n- **Our framing (D039 Pivot)**: Progress stagnation detection 的系统性实证研究。**三层贡献**：(1) **Structural Signal Discovery (primary)** — 系统性对比揭示 stagnation 信号本质是结构性的（结构特征 in-domain 0.9951, cross-domain 0.967），NL embedding 和 LLM-as-judge 均无增量——改变社区对 agent monitoring 方法选型的认知，从表示学习转向轻量结构监控；(2) **LF Temporal Dynamics Analysis** — 量化 LFs 在 agent trajectory 上的时序角色 + 跨 agent 迁移分析 + circular evaluation 问题的方法论贡献——为 sequential data 上的 weak supervision 提供实证指导；(3) **TLM Negative Finding** — 系统性测试三种 temporal label model 实现，均未超越 MV，提供重要的负面结果和 failure analysis——约束未来研究方向。\\\\n\\\\n- **Headline result template**: \\\\\\\"We present a systematic empirical study of progress stagnation detection in LLM agents through weak supervision. Our central finding is that stagnation signals are fundamentally structural: simple features (command repetition ratio, file diff frequency) achieve 0.995 in-domain and 0.967 cross-agent F1, decisively surpassing both neural embedding approaches (0.906/0.751) and LLM-as-judge baselines. We further discover that labeling functions exhibit systematic temporal dynamics — command_repetition leads stagnation onset by ~1.87 steps while outcome_backpropagation lags by +6.7 steps — but these temporal roles are agent-specific (cmd_rep reverses from leading to lagging on OpenHands; removing it improves OH F1 by +21.6pp). Despite these well-characterized temporal patterns motivating a temporal label model, three implementations (TWV, HMM, lag-aware HMM) all fail to improve over simple majority vote — with TWV labels actually degrading downstream classifiers by up to 21.7pp. This negative finding reveals that in the low-conflict regime of current LF frameworks, temporal alignment introduces more noise than signal. Our results redirect agent monitoring from expensive representation learning and complex label models toward lightweight structural approaches.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## Venue Fit Risks\\\\n\\\\n- **EMNLP vs ICSE**: 核心 LFs 和数据 100% 来自 SE 领域。贴合 NLP venue 的策略：(a) weak supervision on sequential data 是通用方法论，适用于任何有时序结构的标注场景——data programming / Snorkel 出自 NLP 社区；(b) structural vs semantic signal 的发现对任何 agent monitoring 系统有指导意义；(c) circular evaluation 问题是 weak supervision 评估的通用挑战；(d) TLM negative finding 对 sequential label model 研究有方法论价值。\\\\n- **Reviewer lottery**: 遇到 SE-skeptical 的 NLP reviewer 可能被判 \\\\\\\"more suitable for ICSE/FSE\\\\\\\"——通过强化方法论洞见的跨域普适性和 LLM agent 社区的 NLP 属性来降低风险。\\\\n- **\\\\\\\"Negative finding paper 不够 novel\\\\\\\"**: 论文不是纯 negative finding——structural signal discovery (Claim 1) 是强正面结果；TLM negative finding (Claim 3) 附带详细 failure analysis 和对未来研究的约束条件。EMNLP 接受 analysis paper 和 well-motivated negative results。\\\\n- **vs PRMs（2025-2026 最拥挤的方向）**: Related Work 加专门小节。核心定位差异：PRM 需要 outcome labels + RL pipeline（昂贵），我们是 monitoring tool + weak supervision pipeline（轻量）；PRM 是 step-level training signal，我们是 window-level detection。\\\\n- **\\\\\\\"Why not LLM-as-judge?\\\\\\\"**: 已有 baseline 对比——structural approach <5ms inference vs LLM 高开销，且 structural +24.3pp。\\\\n\\\\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Countermeasures\\\\n\\\\n| Concern | 应对 |\\\\n|---------|------|\\\\n| Circular evaluation（训练和评估都在自动标签上） | 多层防御：(1) 明确声明 F1 = LF consensus fidelity；(2) structural baseline 0.9951 量化 circularity 上界（逆向工程 LF 规则）；(3) Cross-domain OH 是 non-circular 评估；(4) **Gold set 人工标注**（650 窗口，关键路径） |\\\\n| Structural features outperform everything — so what's the point of the probe? | 诚实报告 + 解读：structural features 在 LF-derived labels 上的 0.9951 是 circularity 上界（features ≈ LF inputs, labels = LF outputs）。Probe 的独立价值在 non-circular 维度：real-time inference、end-to-end deployment、gold set 上的对比。Gold set 是最终裁判 |\\\\n| TLM negative finding 不够有 contribution | Failure analysis 详细到足以约束未来研究：(1) 3-LF 低冲突 regime（conf≥2 一致率 95.1%）限制了 temporal alignment 的改进空间；(2) TWV 在低置信区改变标签方向错误；(3) 三种不同实现排除了实现偏差。论文同时有强正面结果（Claim 1, 2） |\\\\n| 跨 agent 迁移只测了两个 SE agent | Two-agent scope 在 Limitations 讨论 + structural features 跨域 0.967 的强迁移证据。Future work 包含 non-SE agents |\\\\n| 为什么不直接用 LLM | LLM-as-judge baseline 已对比：structural +24.3pp、<5ms vs LLM 高开销 |\\\\n| outcome_backpropagation 信息泄露 | 3-seed holdout：移除 OB 后 f1_stag=0.641±0.034（-22pp），7.1pp 为纯信号贡献。OB 作为 \\\\\\\"Privileged Distant Supervision\\\\\\\"，在 3-LF 框架中不可替代 |\\\\n| Probe 只学了 LF 启发式 | LF oracle baseline（All-Agreement 0.854, probe +5.1pp）+ 错误分析（FP 65% = LF 未覆盖的语义多样停滞）+ gold set 最终验证 |\\\\n| Architecture novelty 不足 | 论文定位为 empirical analysis paper，novelty 在发现和方法论洞见，不在架构 |\\\\n| \\\\\\\"Semantic stagnation\\\\\\\" rebrands existing concepts | 明确映射到现有 agent failure mode taxonomy + window-level formulation 的特殊性论证 |\\\\n| Related work incomplete | 扩展到 30+ references：PRMs / agent self-reflection / weak supervision / agent degradation benchmarks |\\\\n| Embedding model unspecified | 具名 Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B + encoder ablation（BGE/E5/GTE，三者均 >0.90） |\\\\n| LF hold-one-out ablation 解读 | **禁止 \\\\\\\"去掉 X 后 F1 更高\\\\\\\" 的 claim**（test set 偏移假象）。正确框架：覆盖率贡献 + 跨集泛化 + 标签一致性 |\\\\n| OB 移除后 f1_stag 数字来源 | ✅ **已闭环**：outcome-bp-3seed 3-seed mean f1_stag=0.641±0.034（seeds 42/123/456: 0.600/0.640/0.683）。\\\\\\\"0.000\\\\\\\" 来源已溯清：woob 模型在 OB-only 窗口子集（687w）上全预测 progress 导致子集 f1_stag=0.000，非完整测试集结果。D025/D026 已正确撤回。 |\\\\n\\\\n## D039 Pivot 变更记录\\\\n- D034 → D039: Claim 1 TLM（原\\\\\\\"论文最强 claim\\\\\\\"）降级为 Claim 3 negative finding\\\\n- D034 → D039: Claim 2 structural signal 升级为 Claim 1 primary contribution\\\\n- D034 → D039: Claim 3 LF temporal → Claim 2，加入 circular eval methodology\\\\n- D039 新增: TLM 三种实现全败的 failure analysis 作为独立贡献\\\\n- D039 触发实验: structural-on-twv (TWV labels degrade downstream -4.9pp ~ -21.7pp) + twv-ablation (TWV harmful for most σ) + temporal-label-model (HMM/lag-aware HMM failed)\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 9144, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PuqCM1RDwcW4k2cPdFot2U","session_id":"0b19c43c-1b27-4951-bda8-40543516a891","uuid":"9e8a057c-3899-48f2-b857-69db77f6be6d","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:26:42.820Z"}
